    given-names: Sepideh
version: 1.0.0
date-released: '2026-11-18'
repository-code: 'https://github.com/Sepidspec/knee-oa-vlm-benchmark'
url: 'https://github.com/Sepidspec/knee-oa-vlm-benchmark'
abstract: >-
  Reproducibility package for a master thesis evaluating direct five-grade
  Kellgren–Lawrence classification with Qwen2.5-VL-3B-Instruct and ResNet-18,
  including limited-label LoRA, calibration, selective prediction, controls
  and computational cost. Includes a complete publication notebook,
  immutable recorded outputs and CPU analysis reproduction utilities.
keywords:
  - knee osteoarthritis
  - Kellgren–Lawrence grading
  - vision-language models
  - ResNet-18
  - LoRA
  - reproducibility
